BULL + Momentum ↑ (Increasing)

Strong bullish move getting stronger
Best time to BUY
Like accelerating forward


BULL + Momentum ↓ (Decreasing)

Still going up but slowing down
WARNING: Potential reversal coming
Like easing off the gas while driving forward


BEAR + Momentum ↓ (Increasing negatively)

Strong bearish move getting stronger
Best time to SELL/SHORT
Like accelerating in reverse


BEAR + Momentum ↑ (Decreasing negatively)

Still going down but slowing
Potential bottom forming
