Above zero & growing = Bullish momentum strengthening
Above zero & shrinking = Bullish momentum weakening
Below zero & growing more negative = Bearish momentum strengthening
Below zero & shrinking = Bearish momentum weakening

Trading Implications:

Don't chase a BULL trend with decreasing momentum
Don't short a BEAR trend with increasing momentum
Wait for alignment - when trend and momentum move together
